{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">長沙灣呈祥道發生驚心動魄的「無人駕駛」車禍！事發於周一（28日）中午 12 時 17 分，警方接獲的士女乘客求助，指乘搭的士途經呈祥道近荔枝角醫院變電站對開時，66 歲姓李男司機突發暈倒，致使車輛失控撞壆。救護員趕至現場，發現司機陷入昏迷且無表面傷痕，即時將他送往明愛醫院搶救。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-15h44m52s132.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264Tv63VQOzu1790755190.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-15h44m52s132.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事後網上流出一段長約 53 秒的車廂車Cam影片，真實記錄了事發時的生死危急關頭。影片開首已可見司機頭部及雙手無力垂下，陷入昏迷。當時車內乘客起初並未察覺異常，直到車身開始嚴重搖晃，乘客才驚覺司機早已不省人事，急忙不斷拍打其手臂及面部呼喚。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-15h45m30s647.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026i4mgWvIygF1790755206.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-15h45m30s647.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">車輛在無人操控下前行超過半分鐘，情況險象環生，幸好車內乘客反應及時將車輛煞停，最後車輛輕撞石壆停下，化解一場更嚴重的危機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T08:40:09.405477+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}